WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.260
Today is the day! You've done the hard part. A few final reminders before you

2
00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:04.800
head in.

3
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.000
Stop all clear liquids at least four hours before your procedure time, nothing

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.300
to drink after that point, including water.

5
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:16.700
Continue to avoid solid foods and alcohol. Avoid hard candy, gum, and mints.

6
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.200
These count as food and can affect your sedation.

7
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.740
Take a moment to confirm that your output has been running clear. That's the

8
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.700
sign that your prep has done its job.

9
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.400
If you're not there yet, please contact your doctor's office before coming in.

10
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.200
Lastly, your driver should also be ready to go.

11
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:35.230
Your doctor is looking forward to seeing you and taking great care of you today

12
00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:35.400
.
